ceda &agrave; <strong style=\"color: #00a859;\"> APROVA&Ccedil;&Atilde;O</strong> ou <strong style=\"color: #a52a2a;\"> REJEI&Ccedil;&Atilde;O</strong> das p&aacute;ginas do trabalho.&nbsp;<br>Caso precise rejeitar p&aacute;ginas utilize o campo de observa&ccedil;&otilde;es para adicionar <br>eventuais coment&aacute;rios<br><br>Ap&oacute;s avalia&ccedil;&atilde;o de todas as p&aacute;ginas o trabalho ser&aacute; automaticamente devolvido <br>para a Coordena&ccedil;&atilde;o Gr&aacute;fia para prosseguimento.</p>\n    <p style=\"margin: 0 0 15px 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: #333333; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">Acesse o link a seguir para conferir a publica&ccedil;&atilde;o e dar continuidade &agrave; produ&ccedil;&atilde;o.</p>\n    <p style=\"margin: 0 0 20px 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: #333333; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><!-- Bulletproof Button --></p>\n    <table border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n    <tbody>\n    <tr>\n    <td style=\"padding: 10px 0 20px 0;\" align=\"left\">\n    <table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" align=\"left\">\n    <tbody>\n    <tr>\n    <td align=\"left\"><a style=\"text-decoration: none; display: block;\" href=\"{{link}}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> <img style=\"display: block; margin: 0; width: 260px; height: auto;\" src=\"https://drive.google.com/uc?export=view&id=1U-x8Fxj-vKbFvLfahVx_KNAkI_Ny5L6W\" alt=\"Acessar Prova no Apogee\" width=\"260\" border=\"0\"> </a></td>\n    </tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </td>\n    </tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    <p style=\"margin: 0 0 20px 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: #333333; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</p>\n    </td>\n    </tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n    <td align=\"center\"><img style=\"display: block; width: 850px; border: 0;\" src=\"https://drive.google.com/uc?export=view&id=1qbGsxjtwomsSl4yWNJ8O4CcVs4njhCgd\