      "updated_at": "2026-06-03T17:48:17",
      "html": "<table border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n    <tbody>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"padding: 0px 0 0 0;\" align=\"left\">\n  \n          <!-- Main Container Table -->\n          <table style=\"width: 850px; border-collapse: collapse; background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #dddddd; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Segoe, 'Segoe UI', Optima, Arial, sans-serif;\" border=\"0\" width=\"850\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" align=\"left\">\n            <tbody>\n  \n              <!-- Header Banner -->\n              <tr>\n                <td align=\"center\">\n                  <img style=\"display: block; width: 850px; border: 0;\" src=\"https://drive.google.com/uc?export=view&id=1VS_n8YA39TJR6XJBeH7UStcwjloXtZGC\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\">\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n  \n              <!-- Main Content Area -->\n              <tr>\n                <td style=\"padding: 0px 0px 0px 25px;\">\n  \n                  <!-- Job Info Section -->\n                  <table style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\" border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n                    <tbody>\n                      <tr>\n                        <td style=\"padding-right: 18px; padding-top: 25px;\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"120\">\n                          <img style=\"display: block; border: 0;\" src=\"https://drive.google.com/uc?export=view&id=1862FeQwKpoYYijvaquofPG7278nAxDHS\" alt=\"Info\" width=\"120\">\n                        </td>\n  \n                        <td style=\"padding-top: 25px; color: #df1f2d; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.35; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\" valign=\"middle\">\n                          <p style=\"margin: 0 0 8px 0;\">\n                            <strong>Segue relat&oacute;rio de Problemas T&eacute;cnicos encontrados</strong>\n                          </p>\n                          <p style=\"margin: 0;\">\n                            <strong>nos arquivos da Ordem de Servi&ccedil;o [{{nr_os_padded}}/{{ano_curto}}]</strong>\n                          </p>\n                        </td>\n                      </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                  </table>\n  \n                  <!-- Instructions Section -->\n                  <table style=\"margin-bottom: 25px; width: 100%;\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n                    <tbody>\n                      <tr>\n                        <td style=\"padding-right: 0px; width: 15.2933%; text-align: right; margin-right: 5px;\">&nbsp;</td>\n  \n                        <td style=\"width: 84.7202%; padding-top: 20px;\">\n  \n                          <p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px 0; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.5; color: #2e2e2e; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">\n                            Acesse o link a seguir para visualizar os coment&aacute;rios.\n                          </p>\n  \n                          <!-- Bulletproof Button -->\n                          <table border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n                            <tbody>\n                              <tr>\n                                <td style=\"padding: 5px 0 35px 0;\" align=\"left\">\n                                  <table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" align=\"left\">\n                                    <tbody>\n                                      <tr>\n                                        <td align=\"left\">\n                                          <a style=\"text-decoration: none; display: block;\" href=\"{{link}}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n                                            <img style=\"display: block; margin: 0; width: 260px; height: auto;\" src=\"https://drive.google.com/uc?export=view&id=1U-x8Fxj-vKbFvLfahVx_KNAkI_Ny5L6W\" alt=\"Clique para ver o relat&oacute;rio de erros\" width=\"260\" border=\"0\">\n                                          </a>\n                                        </td>\n                                      </tr>\n                                    </tbody>\n                                  </table>\n                                </td>\n                              </tr>\n                            </tbody>\n                          </table>\n  \n                          <p style=\"margin: 0 0 22px 0; font-size: 16.5px; line-height: 1.5; color: #9b1f35; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">\n                            <strong>A CGraf informa que N&Atilde;O faz revis&atilde;o de textos ou de QR Codes utilizados na publica&ccedil;&atilde;o.</strong>\n                          </p>\n  \n                          <p style=\"margin: 0 0 6px 0; font-size: 16.5px; line-height: 1.5; color: #9b1f35; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">\n                            <strong>Em rela&ccedil;&atilde;o &agrave; qualidade de IMAGENS, a CGraf alerta:</strong>\n                          </p>\n  \n                          <p style=\"margin: 0 0 24px 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: #2e2e2e; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">\n                            &bull; A qualidade de impress&atilde;o das imagens depende inteiramente da qualidade das imagens utilizadas no arquivo digital, sendo portanto de responsabilidade do Solicitante.\n                          </p>\n  \n                          <p style=\"margin: 0 0 6px 0; font-size: 16.5px; line-height: 1.5; color: #9b1f35; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">\n                            <strong>Dicas para evitar problemas com qualidade das IMAGENS:</strong>\n                          </p>\n  \n                          <p style=\"margin: 0 0 4px 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.45; color: #2e2e2e; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">\n                            &bull; Quando necess&aacute;rio o redimensionamento de imagens, manipular pela diagonal para evitar distor&ccedil;&atilde;o;\n                          </p>\n  \n                          <p style=\"margin: 0 0 4px 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.45; color: #2e2e2e; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">\n                            &bull; Evitar o uso de imagens sem nitidez ou interpoladas, utilizando 150% de zoom no Acrobat para avalia&ccedil;&atilde;o;\n                          </p>\n  \n                          <p style=\"margin: 0 0 4px 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.45; color: #2e2e2e; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">\n                            &bull; Evitar o uso de imagens escuras em excesso, pois o resultado impresso tende a ser mais escuro do que o que se v&ecirc; na tela do computador;\n                          </p>\n  \n                          <p style=\"margin: 0 0 20px 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.45; color: #2e2e2e; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">\n                            &bull; Evitar o uso de imagens da internet, que em geral n&atilde;o t&ecirc;m a resolu&ccedil;&atilde;o adequada para impress&atilde;o.\n                          </p>\n  \n                        </td>\n                      </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                  </table>\n  \n                </td>\n              </tr>\n  \n              <!-- Footer Banner -->\n              <tr>\n                <td align=\"center\">\n                  <img style=\"display: block; width: 850px; border: 0;\" src=\"https://drive.google.com/uc?export=view&id=1qbGsxjtwomsSl4yWNJ8O4CcVs4njhCgd\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\">\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n  \n            </tbody>\n          </table>\n  \n        </td>\n      </tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>",
      "preset_id": ""
    },
